WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.334
The robot arm moves from the top center to the left, approaching the black bowl located between the plate and the ramekin. It grasps the bowl, lifts it, and moves it to the left to place it onto the plate.

2
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.000
Move arm down and left to approach the black bowl from above

3
00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:03.000
Grasp the black bowl

4
00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:04.500
Lift the bowl and move it left to position over the plate

5
00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:06.000
Lower the bowl onto the plate and release the grasp

6
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Retract arm slightly upwards
